---
import Container from "../common/Container.astro";
---
<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-border py-20 md:py-28 reveal">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr] md:gap-16"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">About Kali</p><div class="max-w-2xl"><h2 class="text-4xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Content that feels like a recommendation from a friend.</h2><p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/65">I'm a creator based in Arizona, making short-form content across travel, beauty, lifestyle, and tech. I care about the details that make a product feel useful, approachable, and worth sharing.</p><p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/65">My goal is simple: create natural, engaging videos that help the right people see themselves using your product.</p></div></div>
  </Container>
</section>
